Looking for the 24/7 server again...	Mencari server 24/7 lagi...
\"%s\" isn't online and uses port %d (reserved for the default server). Edit it to port %d or higher.	\"%s\" tidak online dan menggunakan port %d (dicadangkan untuk server default). Edit ke port %d atau lebih tinggi.
Same server on another phone - moving there (you stay connected).	Server yang sama di telepon lain - pindah ke sana (Anda tetap terhubung).
*** Broker standby #%d/%d: \"%s\" was offline - this phone hosts it in the background until the 24/7 host is back.	*** Broker standby #%d/%d: \"%s\" sedang offline - ponsel ini menghostingnya di latar belakang hingga host 24/7 kembali.
