moderator.txt found: you are [MOD] %s on every MP server (name tag, chat, kill feed, kick / mute).	moderator.txt ditemukan: Anda berada di [MOD] %s di setiap server MP (tag nama, obrolan, matikan umpan, tendang / bisu).
