[TAXI] Your passenger got hurt - a new one is waiting.	[TAXI] Penumpang Anda terluka - ada penumpang baru yang menunggu.
[TAXI] Your car is full.	[TAXI] Mobil Anda penuh.
[TAXI] Passenger: \"Where is your taxi?\" (get in a car)	[TAXI] Penumpang: \"Di mana taksi Anda?\" (masuk ke mobil)
